Maybe there should be a scoring type of evaluation before you are allowed to
embark on a quest (e.g., your quest leader sees that your are a low level
character but that you have good armour and some hefty weapons, so he lets you
go). To protect new players, though, there would have to be some sort of
warning from the quest leader; something along the lines of, "Though you seem
ready for the quest, I have my doubts -- do you wish to proceed?"

Personally, I'd love for there to be more dialogue in the game.

